      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKODA BONNIE (7) is a classy pup building a strong winning record at the journey. Has quickly put herself into the picture to win the last couple of runs. Last start won Q Lakeside in a handy 25.40 beating Bionic Cyndie. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from five starts. In sparkling form with a string of wins and can measure up again. THREE GIRLS (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (20.16) at this track in P5 over 366m. Significant danger. JADE CLOVER (2) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Q Lakeside over 457m behind Professor Moana (26.68) in a OPEN. Was in the money the start prior. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Expected to feature in the finish. TARCISIA (8) should be thereabouts.",
